WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.300
Good design starts by removing barriers.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.300
A learning experience should be perceivable and operable.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.400
It should be understandable and robust.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.700
Accessibility is not an extra layer. It is the foundation of the experience.
